<p> Sugar		  54 (LDD)  7,446     Tasmia	     11/03</p>
<p> General	   1,580 (ULD)  1,219     Vishva Parag     10/03</p>
<p> General	     326 (LDD)  1,042     Vijay		10/03</p>
<p> General	   1,655 (ULD)  1,359     Maribor	    10/03</p>
<p> General	     281 (LDD) 14,719     Maribor	    10/03</p>
<p> Thermal Coal   10,840 (ULD) 30,799     Ch.Nermai	  10/03</p>
<p> Scrap	    22,601 (ULD)  2,645     Energitic	  26/02</p>
<p> Thermal Coal   20,970 (ULD) 13,952     Nand Neeti	 08/03</p>
